<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs019" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>One quotation set large with an accent rule above and the speaker's name and role below, short enough to hold three lines.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="yoySgan9tJ"><hr horizontalAlign="left" width="xs" thickness="md" color="accent"><blockquote><p font-size="lg">Two deliveries a week sounds small. It meant we stopped guessing what to order and stopped running out on Fridays.</p></blockquote><p font-size="sm">Operations lead, regional grocery account · Customer review, June 2026</p></grid-item></grid></section>